    'ruhpolding-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Ruhpolding: Germany''s Biathlon Heartland", "de": "Ruhpolding: Deutschlands Biathlon-Herzland", "fr": "Ruhpolding : Le cœur du biathlon allemand", "it": "Ruhpolding: Il cuore del biathlon tedesco", "es": "Ruhpolding: El corazón del biatlón alemán", "pt": "Ruhpolding: O coração do biatlo alemão", "nl": "Ruhpolding: Het hart van het Duitse biathlon", "ar": "روبولدينغ: قلب البياثلون الألماني", "ja": "ルーポルディング：ドイツのバイアスロンの中心地", "zh": "Ruhpolding: Deguo Dongji Liangxiang de Xinzang", "ko": "루폴딩: 독일 바이애슬론의 심장부"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Chiemgau Arena in Ruhpolding draws massive crowds of passionate German biathlon fans. This Bavarian venue offers one of the best atmospheres on the World Cup circuit.", "de": "Die Chiemgau Arena in Ruhpolding zieht große Massen leidenschaftlicher deutscher Biathlon-Fans an.", "fr": "L''Arena Chiemgau de Ruhpolding attire des foules massives de fans allemands passionnés de biathlon.", "it": "L''Arena Chiemgau di Ruhpolding attira enormi folle di appassionati fan tedeschi di biathlon.", "es": "El Arena Chiemgau en Ruhpolding atrae a multitudes masivas de apasionados fans alemanes del biatlón.", "pt": "A Arena Chiemgau em Ruhpolding atrai multidões massivas de apaixonados fãs alemães de biatlo.", "nl": "De Chiemgau Arena in Ruhpolding trekt enorme menigten van gepassioneerde Duitse biathlonfans.", "ar": "يجذب ملعب شيمغاو في روبولدينغ حشوداً هائلة من محبي البياثلون الألمان المتحمسين", "ja": "ルーポルディングのキームガウアリーナは、熱狂的なドイツのバイアスロンファンを大勢集めます。", "zh": "Ruhpolding de Chiemgau Arena xiyin le dapi chongman reqing de Deguo dongji liangxiang fensi.", "ko": "루폴딩의 킴가우 아레나는 열정적인 독일 바이애슬론 팬들의 대규모 관중을 끌어들입니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Ruhpolding''s Chiemgau Arena has earned its reputation as one of the most atmospheric venues on the <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> World Cup circuit. German fans are among the most passionate and knowledgeable in the sport.</p><h2>The Venue</h2><p>The arena sits at approximately 700 meters elevation in the beautiful Bavarian Alps. The compact stadium layout allows spectators to feel close to the action at the shooting range while maintaining views of key portions of the ski course.</p><p>The facility can accommodate over 20,000 spectators, and events regularly sell out months in advance.</p><h2>German Biathlon Culture</h2><p>Biathlon holds a special place in German winter sports culture. The combination of skiing and shooting appeals to fans who appreciate both the athletic and tactical elements of the sport.</p><p>Athletes like <a href=\"/franziska-preuss-profile/\">Franziska Preuß</a> compete in front of these passionate home crowds, while international stars draw enormous respect.</p><h2>The Courses</h2><p>The trails around Chiemgau Arena challenge athletes with varied terrain. Sections through forests alternate with open areas where spectators can cheer as racers pass by.</p><p>The shooting range is positioned for optimal viewing, allowing fans to experience the drama as athletes steady their aim and fire at targets.</p><h2>Location</h2><p>Ruhpolding is located in Upper Bavaria, about 100 km southeast of Munich. The traditional Bavarian village offers charming accommodation, excellent local cuisine, and a genuine Alpine atmosphere.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>The venue is accessible from Munich Airport (about 90 minutes by car) or via train to Traunstein followed by local transport.</p><h2>Beyond Biathlon</h2><p>The Chiemgau region offers extensive winter sports opportunities beyond World Cup events, including cross-country skiing trails and alpine skiing at nearby resorts.</p>", "de": "<p>Die Chiemgau Arena in Ruhpolding hat sich als einer der atmosphärischsten Austragungsorte im <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a>-Weltcup einen Namen gemacht. Deutsche Fans gehören zu den leidenschaftlichsten und kenntnisreichsten im Sport.</p><h2>Die Anlage</h2><p>Die Arena liegt auf etwa 700 Metern Höhe in den wunderschönen bayerischen Alpen.</p><h2>Deutsche Biathlon-Kultur</h2><p>Biathlon nimmt einen besonderen Platz in der deutschen Wintersportkultur ein. Athleten wie <a href=\"/franziska-preuss-profile/\">Franziska Preuß</a> treten vor diesen leidenschaftlichen Heimfans an.</p><h2>Lage</h2><p>Ruhpolding liegt in Oberbayern, etwa 100 km südöstlich von München.</p>", "fr": "<p>L''Arena Chiemgau de Ruhpolding s''est forgé une réputation comme l''un des sites les plus atmosphériques du circuit de Coupe du monde de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a>. Les fans allemands sont parmi les plus passionnés et connaisseurs du sport.</p><h2>Le site</h2><p>L''arène se situe à environ 700 mètres d''altitude dans les magnifiques Alpes bavaroises.</p><h2>Culture du biathlon allemand</h2><p>Des athlètes comme <a href=\"/franziska-preuss-profile/\">Franziska Preuß</a> concourent devant ces foules passionnées.</p>", "it": "<p>La Chiemgau Arena di Ruhpolding si è guadagnata la reputazione di uno dei luoghi più atmosferici del circuito di Coppa del Mondo di <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a>. I fan tedeschi sono tra i più appassionati e competenti dello sport.</p><h2>La sede</h2><p>L''arena si trova a circa 700 metri di altitudine nelle splendide Alpi bavaresi.</p><h2>Cultura del biathlon tedesco</h2><p>Atleti come <a href=\"/franziska-preuss-profile/\">Franziska Preuß</a> gareggiano davanti a questi appassionati tifosi.</p>", "es": "<p>El Arena Chiemgau de Ruhpolding se ha ganado su reputación como uno de los lugares con más atmósfera del circuito de la Copa del Mundo de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlón</a>. Los fans alemanes están entre los más apasionados del deporte.</p><h2>El lugar</h2><p>El arena se encuentra a aproximadamente 700 metros de altitud en los hermosos Alpes bávaros.</p>", "pt": "<p>A Arena Chiemgau em Ruhpolding ganhou sua reputação como um dos locais com mais atmosfera do circuito da Copa do Mundo de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlo</a>. Os fãs alemães estão entre os mais apaixonados do esporte.</p><h2>O local</h2><p>A arena fica a aproximadamente 700 metros de altitude nos belos Alpes bávaros.</p>", "nl": "<p>De Chiemgau Arena in Ruhpolding heeft zijn reputatie verdiend als een van de meest sfeervolle locaties op het <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> Wereldbekercircuit. Duitse fans behoren tot de meest gepassioneerde van de sport.</p><h2>De locatie</h2><p>De arena ligt op ongeveer 700 meter hoogte in de prachtige Beierse Alpen.</p>", "ar": "<p>اكتسب ملعب شيمغاو في روبولدينغ سمعته كواحد من أكثر الملاعب إثارة في دورة كأس العالم <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">للبياثلون</a>. المشجعون الألمان هم من بين الأكثر شغفاً في الرياضة.</p><h2>الموقع</h2><p>يقع الملعب على ارتفاع حوالي 700 متر في جبال الألب البافارية الجميلة.</p>", "ja": "<p>ルーポルディングのキームガウアリーナは、<a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">バイアスロン</a>ワールドカップサーキットで最も雰囲気のある会場の一つとしての評判を得ています。ドイツのファンは、このスポーツで最も情熱的で知識が豊富です。</p><h2>会場</h2><p>アリーナは美しいバイエルンアルプスの標高約700メートルに位置しています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Ruhpolding de Chiemgau Arena yi chengwei <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">dongji liangxiang</a> Shijie Bei saisaidao zhong zui you qifen de changguan zhiyi. Deguo fensi shi yundong zhong zui chongman reqing he zhuye zhishi de.</p><h2>Changguan</h2><p>Jingji chang weiyue meili de Bafaliya Aerbisi, haiba yue 700 mi.</p>", "ko": "<p>루폴딩의 킴가우 아레나는 <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">바이애슬론</a> 월드컵 서킷에서 가장 분위기 있는 경기장 중 하나로 명성을 얻었습니다. 독일 팬들은 이 스포츠에서 가장 열정적이고 박식합니다.</p><h2>경기장</h2><p>아레나는 아름다운 바이에른 알프스의 해발 약 700미터에 위치해 있습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
